###  http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/Capacite
<http://www.semanticweb.org/arthu/ontologies/2026/0/OntoPokemon/Capacite> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                          rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
